.oculus.vrshell-20250909-134650.png", "id": "1874648519751569", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304229_1874648523084902_183850387910932017_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KyUuIpGLTdwQ7kNvwHRxOHQ&_nc_oc=AdqSCdJuoviA1tlZ--0oa87_8UA4AjHrqYbQNZQZQ-o_2olsSQZLYhGQD3iKphg813s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af46m3ex6e2YnIJB-9qT78WJpZ2QRncdCbN2DCGyML7_2g&oe=69FF2FD8"}, {"file_name": "metafied-com.oculus.vrshell-20250909-133810.png", "id": "1781536295816998", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620309_1781536299150331_1668337338983980294_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zZQ6s-bzAcYQ7kNvwGtdQAx&_nc_oc=Adr-b3V4RciQelRvTGqFDvC5R_73I7NXL1RShDBpFI-46kbRISovNJWy03KLylFJe1k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af42bjpK05Y6vWuHgwFOYKejzXLfqqwVlz4YSBP9ud3E0A&oe=69FF2041"}, {"file_name": "metafied-com.oculus.vrshell-20250909-134434.png", "id": "24277725275244158", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303769_24277725291910823_1801811960652122137_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fro8kMTTpGMQ7kNvwGJfpOn&_nc_oc=AdpnT20du9y2otW1yj6BZL4HAvwiXy98w97Sxw-gIZXRHttz4JfoAtHQAC3vKiMUyyA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af40eKTHCA8F6MZYStdmWkFjNwIZ-4XoJ9wIEmMOoCgTuA&oe=69FF430C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Augmental Puzzles", "keywords": ["logic", "puzzle", "numbers", "sudoku", "calming"], "long_description": "Master complex puzzles with smart highlighting and intelligent hints.\n\nCorrect mistakes instantly using the infinite undo and replay.\n\nPuzzles crafted by hand, computer verified. Tasty Sourdough-ku!\n\nCheck solutions on the fly to help you solve them with absolute confidence!\n\n{3270784359741014}\n- **Intelligent highlighting** - Making a wrong placement highlights  it, as well as any other number that it clashes with so you can see where the problem lies! \n\n- **Hint System** - We all get stuck sometimes. With our Intelligent Help feature you can get a hint to get you going again.\n\n- **Infinite Undo** - Made a mistake? Not a problem. You can undo it to your heart\u2019s content. Replay allows you to rewatch how you solved the puzzle to learn from your journey.\n\n- **Rules validation** - Making sure you put your numbers correctly according to the sudoku rules.\n\n- **Solution checker** - Checks against the solution for this puzzle. It\u2019s non-intrusive and can be turned off if you\u2019d rather try on your own first.\n\n- **Cloud Save** - Taking a break? Come back and continue your puzzle anytime. There is never any rush with our game.\n\n\n\n# Daily challenges\n{1922426285376151}\nEvery day there is a new sudoku puzzle for you to solve.\n\n\n# Scoring leaderboards\n{4136742409975957}\nFor the competitive puzzlers among us, climb the Daily Challenge Leaderboards.\n\n\n# Handset puzzles\n{1155457683408305}\nAll of our puzzles are handset and come in different sizes!\n", "short_description": "Unwind your mind with Augmental Puzzles, a soothing Puzzle experience designed for daily play. Enjoy a fresh puzzle every day, climb the global leaderboard, and immerse yourself in the quiet satisfaction of logic and focus."}]}, "developer_name": "Flammable Penguins Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://flammablepenguins.com/augmental_puzzles/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://flammablepenguins.com/augmental_puzzles/eula.html", "publisher_name": "Flammable Penguins Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.flammablepenguins.com/augmental_puzzles/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED"